+# Files that belong to this repository's working history but not to a published source
+# archive. `export-ignore` applies to `git archive`, which is what a release tarball is
+# produced by, so a downloaded release carries the package and nothing else.
+#
+# It does not reach a SwiftPM checkout: SwiftPM clones the repository, and a clone carries
+# every tracked file by construction. That channel cannot be filtered from here.
+PLAN.md export-ignore
+BACKLOG.md export-ignore
+JOURNAL.md export-ignore
+JOURNAL-archive.md export-ignore
+.jeffy/ export-ignore
+.jeffy/** export-ignore
+.gitattributes export-ignore
